N1  - D2. The eDE algorithm has been presented in [51]. eDE was compared to mixed-integer linear programming to validate its accuracy when minimizing operating costs in a complex energy system in [52]. eDE showed great searching capability in that the difference between the given results for MILP and eDE was less than 1%. 
